### ==========================================
### MRP API
### ==========================================

### ====================
### 1. AUTH
### ====================

### Register User
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user1",
  "password": "pass123"
}

###

### Login User
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user1",
  "password": "pass123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.token);
    client.log("✓ Token saved: " + response.body.token);
%}

###

### ====================
### 2. USER
### ====================

### Get Profile
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/user1/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### Update Profile
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/users/USER_ID_HERE/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "favoriteGenre": "sci-fi"
}

###

### Get Leaderboard
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/leaderboard
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### ====================
### 3. MEDIA
### ====================

### Create Media Entry
POST http://localhost:8080/api/media
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Inception",
  "description": "Sci-fi thriller",
  "mediaType": "MOVIE",
  "releaseYear": 2010,
  "genres": [
    "sci-fi",
    "thriller"
  ],
  "ageRestriction": 12
}

> {%
    client.global.set("media_id", response.body.id);
    client.log("✓ Media created: " + response.body.id);
%}

###

### Get All Media
GET http://localhost:8080/api/media
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### Get Media by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/media/{{media_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### Search Media by Title
GET http://localhost:8080/api/media/search?title=incep
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### Filter by Genre
GET http://localhost:8080/api/media?genre=sci-fi
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### Filter by Type
GET http://localhost:8080/api/media?type=MOVIE
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### Filter by Year
GET http://localhost:8080/api/media?year=2010
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### Filter by Age Restriction
GET http://localhost:8080/api/media?age=13
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### Sort by Rating
GET http://localhost:8080/api/media?sort=rating
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### Combined Filters
GET http://localhost:8080/api/media?genre=sci-fi&type=MOVIE&sort=rating
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### Update Media Entry
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/media/{{media_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Inception Updated",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "mediaType": "MOVIE",
  "releaseYear": 2010,
  "genres": [
    "sci-fi",
    "action"
  ],
  "ageRestriction": 16
}

###

### Delete Media Entry
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/media/{{media_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### ====================
### 4. RATING
### ====================

### Create Rating
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ratings
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mediaId": "{{media_id}}",
  "stars": 5,
  "comment": "Amazing movie!"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("ratings_id", response.body.id);
    client.log("✓ Rating created: " + response.body.id);
%}

###

### Get Ratings for Media
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ratings/media/{{media_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### Get Ratings by User
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ratings/user/USER_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### Update Rating
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/ratings/{{rating_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stars": 4,
  "comment": "Updated comment"
}

###

### Confirm Rating Comment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ratings/{{rating_id}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### Like Rating
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ratings/{{rating_id}}/like
Authorization: Bearer user2-mrpToken

###

### Delete Rating
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/ratings/{{rating_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### ====================
### 5. FAVORITES
### ====================

### Add to Favorites
POST http://localhost:8080/api/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mediaId": "{{media_id}}"
}

###

### Get User Favorites
GET http://localhost:8080/api/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### Remove from Favorites
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/favorites/{{media_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### ====================
### 6. RECOMMENDATION
### ====================

### Get Recommendations
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recommendations
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### Get Recommendations (Limited)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recommendations?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###
